        <profile name="Resurrection" typeId="058c-866b-6487-ccc4" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="4512-c6c3-bb7a-4fb5">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2ecd-b4ff-9e78-a8e2">Resurrection: If a Leper-Pilgrim is killed after a game (see the Campaign Rules in the Trench Crusade Rulebook), they can be resurrected as a Martyr Penitent with the Martyr Penitent Profile for a cost of 45 ducats. Add -1 INJURY DICE to Injury Rolls for a Martyr Penitent. A Martyr Penitent keeps their Battlekit and Zealot Strength if the ability was purchased, but loses any Battle Scars, Experience, and Advancements. Martyrdom Pills have no effect on a Martyr Penitent model.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
