        <profile name="Agile" typeId="058c-866b-6487-ccc4" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="239a-64ac-6630-4a01"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="2ecd-b4ff-9e78-a8e2">Agile: Add +1 DICE to the Risky Success Roll when a Stigmatic Nun Climbs, Jumps, or makes a Diving Charge, or takes a Dash ACTION.</characteristic></characteristics></profile>
        <profile name="Blessed Stigmata" typeId="058c-866b-6487-ccc4" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="0e04-c99e-1e80-4a01"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="2ecd-b4ff-9e78-a8e2">Blessed Stigmata: Each time you remove a BLOOD MARKER from a Stigmatic Nun due to the REGENERATE 1 Keyword, place 1 BLESSING MARKER next to the Stigmatic Nun.</characteristic></characteristics></profile>
      </profiles>
